[{"answer":"Erm... hello Professor, I'm John Wishart.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm working on my entry for the Global Design Competition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My tutor said you might be able to help me with it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, yes, I got a copy of your drawings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Come in and tell me about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of competition is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's an international design competition","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and we have to come up with a new design for a typical domestic kitchen appliance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I see, and are there any special conditions? Does it have to save energy for example?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually that was the focus in last year's competition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/10.mp3"},{"answer":"This year's different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/11.mp3"},{"answer":"We have to adopt an innovative approach to existing technology,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/12.mp3"},{"answer":"using it in a way that hasn't been thought of before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I see, that sounds tricky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/14.mp3"},{"answer":"And what kitchen appliance have you chosen?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I decided to choose the dishwasher.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Interesting, what made you choose that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they're an everyday kitchen appliance in most Australian houses","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/18.mp3"},{"answer":"but they're all pretty boring and almost identical to each other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I think some people will be prepared to pay a little extra for something that looks different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/20.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a nice idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I see you've called your design 'the Rockpool'; why is that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Basically because it looks like the rock pools you find on a beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/23.mp3"},{"answer":"The top is made of glass so that you can look down into it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/24.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's a stone at the bottom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that just for decoration?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually it does have a function.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Instead of pushing a button, you turn the stone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's really just a novel way of starting the dishwasher.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/29.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/30.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a really nice design, but what makes it innovative?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I decided to make a dishwasher that uses carbon dioxide.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/32.mp3"},{"answer":"In place of water and detergent?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/33.mp3"},{"answer":"How will you manage that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/34.mp3"},{"answer":"The idea is to pressurize the carbon dioxide so that it becomes a liquid.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/35.mp3"},{"answer":"The fluid is then released into the dishwasher where it cleans the dishes all by itself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds like a brilliant idea!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Your system will totally do away with the need for strong detergents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/38.mp3"},{"answer":"So what happens once the dishes are clean?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, to allow them to dry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/40.mp3"},{"answer":"the liquid carbon dioxide and the waste materials all go to an area called the holding chamber.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/41.mp3"},{"answer":"That's where the liquid is depressurised and so it reverts to a gas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the oil and grease are separated out and sent to the waste system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/43.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds like you've thought it all out very thoroughly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/44.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what happens to the carbon dioxide once the process is complete?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Not wasted I hope.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, that's where the real savings are made.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/47.mp3"},{"answer":"The carbon dioxide is sent back to the cylinder and can be used again and again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/48.mp3"},{"answer":"What a terrific idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think it will ever be built?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Probably not, but that's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm sure a lot of positive things will come out of your design.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, you seem to have thought about everything so what exactly did you need me to help you with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, my design has made it to the final stage of the competition","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and, in a few months' time. I have to give a presentation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's the part I was hoping you could help me with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well that should be easy enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/57.mp3"},{"answer":"What have you managed to do so far?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've got detailed drawings to show how it will work","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and I've also written a 500-word paper on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if you want to stand a good chance of winning you really need a model of the machine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I thought I might but I'm having a few problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/63.mp3"},{"answer":"What is the main difficulty so far?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me guess - is it the materials?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I want it to look professional but everything that's top quality is also very expensive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Look, projects like this are very important to us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/68.mp3"},{"answer":"They really help lift our profile.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/69.mp3"},{"answer":"So why don't you talk to the university about a grant?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I can help you fill out the application forms if you like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/71.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/72.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd better show me this paper you've written as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/73.mp3"},{"answer":"For a global competition such as this","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/74.mp3"},{"answer":"you need to make sure the technical details you've given are accurate and thorough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that would be a great help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything else I can do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm really...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-10-test-1-part-3-2023-06-09-21-55-33/78.mp3"}]
